{"title":"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following inequalities are satisfied for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/b/73b82fda3d08dbbad4a7236c7ac68a89eaeef80f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c, x, y, z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" /> which satisfy the conditions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/d/7bdd80793b694b86cd8913b4512c5ea6155fc1b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; a, y &lt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/1/6d1f07d1e916084ef39c9192ff5c25a688905f2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z &lt; c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"10\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/1305eaa2c47a52f85807cbbf430c3632bd9c62e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{I}. \\ xy + yz + zx &lt; ab + bc + ca \\\\ \\text{II}. \\ x^2 + y^2 + z^2 &lt; a^2 + b^2 + c^2 \\\\ \\text{III}. \\ xyz &lt; abc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"238\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/6/b36ffdf2975d75965cc59d0ac9485e89e3caa4cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{None are satisfied.} \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{I only} \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{II only} \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{III only} \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{All are satisfied.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"700\" height=\"17\" />   \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p><br />\nNotice if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then we can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> to disprove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/102a710f194f49e771624b3fdfd463997dcd77fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{I}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaa06527b45dc31abd08e7dabdb969339552eb7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{II}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />. For example, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/e/89e310e6abe8567eb7453941c756a72becd2e18d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c, x, y, z) = (0, 0, 0, -1, -1, -1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"283\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/102a710f194f49e771624b3fdfd463997dcd77fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{I}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaa06527b45dc31abd08e7dabdb969339552eb7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{II}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> are disproved. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25e850f9ed5e600521b747f8b07ed74574d44a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c, x, y, z) = (0, 1, 2, -1, -1, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"269\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/7/a271f6f756092f6f44ef63a500c6a064c1c0510b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{III}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> is disproved. Therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/c/3ec16f84f3aea4287177226d8e15c38697b99bef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } \\text{None are satisfied}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"176\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSM